DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uuttss driver provides support for USB touchscreens.  Access to the
     touchscreen is provided through the wscons(4) framework.

     Touching the screen will emulate mouse button 0 being pressed.

     The touchscreen sensor is poorly aligned, therefore xtsscale(1) should be
     used to provide calibration results to the uuttss driver.

     The uuttss driver works with the following touchscreens and panels:

           --   Gunze USB Touch Panel
           --   Hantouch
           --   LG L1510SF LCD Monitor
           --   Origin AE X15e HTPC case with 7" LCD

